<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=210mm">
  <style>
    /* Línea de la app: #1e293b, #f8fafc, #e2e8f0, system UI. Sin cortes: overflow visible, evitar break dentro de bloques. */
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      overflow: visible;
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.5;
      color: #1e293b;
      background: #fff !important;
    }
    body { padding: 24px 28px; min-height: auto; }

    .cert-page { overflow: visible; page-break-after: auto; }
    .cert-page .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      padding-bottom: 16px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .cert-page .header img {
      max-height: 64px;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      display: block;
      margin-left: auto;
      margin-right: auto;
    }
    .cert-page .header h1 {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.02em;
      margin: 8px 0 4px 0;
      color: #1e293b;
    }
    .cert-page .header h2 {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 400;
      margin: 0;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .cert-page .empresa-info {
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .cert-page .body-text {
      text-align: justify;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      page-break-inside: avoid;
    }
    .cert-page .body-text p { margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .cert-page .summary-wrap { page-break-inside: avoid; margin: 20px 0; }
    .cert-page table.summary {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 13px;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .cert-page table.summary th {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: #475569;
    }
    .cert-page table.summary td {
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      color: #1e293b;
    }
    .cert-page table.summary td.number {
      text-align: right;
      font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .cert-page .closing { margin-top: 28px; page-break-inside: avoid; }
    .cert-page .closing p { margin-bottom: 4px; }
    .cert-page .signature { margin-top: 28px; page-break-inside: avoid; }
    .cert-page .signature-image { margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .cert-page .signature-image img {
      max-height: 64px;
      max-width: 220px;
      display: block;
    }
    .cert-page .signature-line {
      border-top: 1px solid #334155;
      width: 240px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      padding-top: 6px;
    }
    .cert-page .signature--no-image .signature-line { margin-top: 48px; }
    .cert-page .signature-name { font-weight: 600; font-size: 13px; color: #1e293b; }
    .cert-page .signature-id, .cert-page .signature-role { font-size: 12px; color: #64748b; }

    /* Segunda página: detalle (mismo sistema de diseño) */
    .details-section { overflow: visible; padding-top: 8px; }
    .details-section .header {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .details-section .header h1 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin: 0 0 4px 0; color: #1e293b; }
    .details-section .header h2 { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; color: #64748b; margin: 0; }
    .details-section .info-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #64748b;
    }
    .details-section table.details {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 16px 0;
      font-size: 13px;
      background: #fff;
    }
    .details-section table.details th {
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      text-align: left;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #475569;
    }
    .details-section table.details td {
      border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      color: #1e293b;
    }
    .details-section table.details td.number {
      text-align: right;
      font-family: ui-monospace, 'SF Mono', Consolas, monospace;
      font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    }
    .details-section table.details td.code { font-family: ui-monospace, Consolas, monospace; font-size: 12px; }
    .details-section table.details tfoot td {
      font-weight: 600;
      background: #f1f5f9;
      border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    }
    .details-section .footer-note {
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #64748b;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="cert-page">
    <div class="header">
      {{#if empresa_imagen}}
      <img src="{{empresa_imagen}}" alt="Logo">
      {{/if}}
      <h1>Certificado Tributario</h1>
      <h2>AG {{year}}</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="empresa-info">
      <strong>{{empresa_nombre}}</strong><br>
      NIT: {{empresa_nit}}
    </div>

    <div class="body-text">
      <p>
        La empresa <strong>{{empresa_nombre}}</strong>, identificada con NIT <strong>{{empresa_nit}}</strong>,
        representada legalmente por <strong>{{representante_legal_nombre}}</strong>, identificado(a) con cédula de ciudadanía
        No. <strong>{{representante_legal_id}}</strong>, certifica que se realizó un pago a
        <strong>{{third_name}}</strong>, identificado(a) con documento No. <strong>{{id}}</strong>,
        en la ciudad de <strong>{{city}}</strong>, correspondiente al periodo <strong>{{date_range}}</strong>.
      </p>
      <p>
        A continuación se detalla el resumen de la operación:
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="summary-wrap">
      <table class="summary">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Ciudad</th>
            <th>Fecha de Pago</th>
            <th>Cantidad Adquirida</th>
            <th>Valor Total COP</th>
            <th>Retención</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>{{city}}</td>
            <td>{{date_range}}</td>
            <td class="number">{{total_amount}}</td>
            <td class="number">{{total_price}}</td>
            <td>{{retencion}}</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <div class="closing">
      <p>Se expide el presente certificado a solicitud del interesado.</p>
      <p>Atentamente,</p>
    </div>

    <div class="signature {{#unless firmante_imagen}}signature--no-image{{/unless}}">
      {{#if firmante_imagen}}
      <div class="signature-image">
        <img src="{{firmante_imagen}}" alt="Firma">
      </div>
      {{/if}}
      <div class="signature-line">
        <div class="signature-name">{{firma_nombre}}</div>
        <div class="signature-id">T.P. {{firma_id}}</div>
        <div class="signature-role">Representante Legal - {{empresa_nombre}}</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
